# 6. CAREQUEUE — THE CORE HACKATHON MODULE

THIS IS THE MOST IMPORTANT MODULE.

Build a complete working outpatient queue management system.

It must satisfy the official ClinicQueue problem statement.

## Required Features

- Appointment check-in.
- Walk-in check-in.
- Department-wise queues.
- Doctor-wise queues.
- Token generation.
- Current token display.
